msgid "No problems found in the NVDA log. For more thorough detection, consider setting NVDA's Logging Level to Debug in General Settings."
msgstr "NVDA 記錄檔中未發現問題。若要進行更徹底的偵測，請考慮在「一般設定」中將 NVDA 的記錄層級設為「除錯」。"

#: crash_analyzer.py:431
msgid "No problems found in the NVDA log. NVDA looks healthy."
msgstr "NVDA 記錄檔中未發現問題。NVDA 運作正常。"

